		(property "Description" "The PA107 is a high-voltage, high-speed power operational amplifier that is capable of slew rates up to 3,000 V/s, which raises the bar for single-packaged hybrids. The PA107 also improves output current performance with 1.5 A (5 A PEAK), a high gain bandwidth of 180 MHz, and can operate on single supply voltages up to 200 V.  The PA107 is an attractive option for driving piezos used in medical imaging and ultrasound applications, as well as programmable power supplies for the ATE market because the high s"
